  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nHammond, Indiana — On Thursday, May 8, 2025, at approximately 5:49 p.m., Chicago Police Officers responded to a person with a gun call in the 13400 block of S. Baltimore Avenue for a suspect, later identified as 50-year-old Joseph Navarro, wanted for an aggravated battery. Officers observed Navarro enter a vehicle. Navarro fled from the area and crashed his vehicle at Dearborn and Gostlin St. in Hammond, Indiana. Officers arrived at the location where they were fired upon and returned fire striking Navarro. Navarro was struck multiple times and was transported to St. Catherine Hospital where he was pronounced deceased. The two officers were taken to a hospital for observation and were reported to be in good condition. No other injuries were reported, and a gun was recovered at the scene.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Bagpiper Joshua Agee\n- '1000ak'\n- 'Excellent I. McGill IV'\n- Arnelle Dunlap\n- FloridaOperative\n- thomas\n- 'PrussianBlue'\n- Cody Stephens\n- Kaedyn\n- Daniel G\n- David, Guershom\n- 'K9 Kampers with Alfredo'\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- '10izshoe'\n- 'Wilcer - Crank Hustle'\n- 'DerLitti86'\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- Brandon M.\n- Jesse\n- Jeff Short\n- RayJayOB\n- Sean Sheldon\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- James Pringle\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- 'Brother.Legal'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- 'Krazy KZ'\n- Zach Williams\n- Michael R Sheffield\n- Rich Biggs\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- 'Necko'\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSupport us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/PoliceActivity\nFollow us on X: https://x.com/Police_Activity\n\n- Links to the Best Dash Cams you can buy.\nViofo A229 Pro 4K HDR: https://amzn.to/4dYwN2b\